---
import Layout from "../../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="ARK: Survival Evolved Server Hosting - QuackHost" description="Premium ARK: Survival Evolved server hosting with instant setup, mod support, cluster configuration, and DDoS protection. Perfect for survival tribes of any size.">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-100 via-gray-90 to-gray-100">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 lg:py-32">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50/5 via-transparent to-cyan-50/5"></div>

			<div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
					<div class="inline-block mb-6 px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50/20 to-cyan-50/20 rounded-full border border-green-50/30">
						<span class="text-green-50 font-bold text-sm">ARK: SURVIVAL EVOLVED HOSTING</span>
					</div>

					<h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-green-50 to-cyan-50 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
						Powerful ARK Server Hosting
					</h1>

					<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
						Host your ARK: Survival Evolved server with high-performance hardware, full mod support, cluster configuration, and 24/7 DDoS protection. Perfect for tribes of any size.
					</p>

					<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center mb-12">
						<a href="/pricing" class="px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF9C20] to-[#FF8D00] text-black font-bold rounded-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#FF9C20]/20 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
							Get Started
						</a>
						<a href="/games" class="px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 text-white font-bold rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-80 hover:border-[#FF9C20] transition-all duration-300">
							View All Games
						</a>
					</div>

					<!-- Quick Stats -->
					<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">5min</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Setup Time</div>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">70+</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Players Max</div>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">100%</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Mod Support</div>
						</div>
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80">
							<div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">24/7</div>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-sm">Online</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Key Features -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							Everything You Need for ARK
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
							Host your ARK server with enterprise-grade hardware and tools designed specifically for survival games.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
						<!-- Feature 1 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🦖</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Instant Server Setup</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Choose your map (The Island, Ragnarok, Valguero, Genesis, etc.), configure settings, and your ARK server is online in minutes.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 2 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🔧</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Full Mod Support</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Install any Steam Workshop mod with one click. S+, Awesome Spyglass, ARK Additions, and thousands more supported.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 3 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🗺️</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Cluster Configuration</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Set up multi-server clusters with shared character and item transfers. Perfect for running multiple maps.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 4 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">💾</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Automated Backups</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Hourly automated backups protect your tribe's progress. Restore from any backup point with one click.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 5 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">🛡️</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">DDoS Protection</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								Enterprise-grade DDoS protection keeps your server online even during attacks. Never lose progress to downtime.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Feature 6 -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
								<span class="text-2xl">⚡</span>
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">High-Performance Hardware</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								AMD Ryzen 9 7950X3D CPUs and NVMe SSDs ensure smooth gameplay even with 70+ players and heavy mods.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Pricing Section -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							ARK Server Pricing
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20">
							Choose the perfect plan for your tribe size and playstyle
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Pricing Note -->
					<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50/10 to-cyan-50/10 border-2 border-green-50/50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-12 text-center">
						<p class="text-white mb-2">
							<strong>Note:</strong> ARK requires significant resources. We recommend starting with Goose (16GB) for optimal performance.
						</p>
						<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">Duck plan suitable for small tribes only (10-15 players max)</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
						<!-- Duck Plan -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Duck</h3>
							<div class="mb-4">
								<span class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">$8</span>
								<span class="text-cool-gray-40">/month</span>
							</div>
							<ul class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span><strong class="text-white">10-15 players</strong></span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>8GB DDR5 RAM</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>2 CPU cores (Ryzen 9 7950X3D)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>40GB NVMe storage</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>Unlimited bandwidth</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>DDoS protection</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<a href="/pricing" class="block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 text-white font-bold rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50 transition-all duration-300">
								Get Started
							</a>
						</div>

						<!-- Goose Plan (Popular) -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-[#FF9C20] rounded-xl p-8 relative transform scale-105">
							<div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#FF9C20] text-black text-xs font-bold rounded-full">
								POPULAR
							</div>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Goose</h3>
							<div class="mb-4">
								<span class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">$16</span>
								<span class="text-cool-gray-40">/month</span>
							</div>
							<ul class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span><strong class="text-white">25-40 players</strong></span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>16GB DDR5 RAM</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>4 CPU cores (Ryzen 9 7950X3D)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>80GB NVMe storage</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>Unlimited bandwidth</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>DDoS protection</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-[#FF9C20]">✓</span>
									<span>Priority support</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<a href="/pricing" class="block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF9C20] to-[#FF8D00] text-black font-bold rounded-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#FF9C20]/20 transition-all duration-300">
								Get Started
							</a>
						</div>

						<!-- Swan Plan -->
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 border-2 border-gray-80 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Swan</h3>
							<div class="mb-4">
								<span class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">$32</span>
								<span class="text-cool-gray-40">/month</span>
							</div>
							<ul class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span><strong class="text-white">50-70 players</strong></span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>32GB DDR5 RAM</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>8 CPU cores (Ryzen 9 7950X3D)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>160GB NVMe storage</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>Unlimited bandwidth</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>DDoS protection</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>Priority support</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-green-50">✓</span>
									<span>Cluster support</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<a href="/pricing" class="block w-full text-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 text-white font-bold rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50 transition-all duration-300">
								Get Started
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Popular Mods Section -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							Popular ARK Mods
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xl text-cool-gray-20">
							Install any Steam Workshop mod with one click through QuackPlane
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">Structures Plus (S+)</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Enhanced building mechanics, auto-crafting, item pulling, resource conversion</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Essential Mod</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">Awesome Spyglass</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">See creature stats, levels, and info before taming</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Quality of Life</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">ARK Additions</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">New creatures like Deinosuchus, Archelon, and Concavenator</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Content Expansion</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">Classic Flyers</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Re-enables flyer speed leveling for enhanced mobility</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Gameplay Modifier</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">Dino Storage v2</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Store tamed creatures in pokéballs, manage large dino collections</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Quality of Life</div>
						</div>

						<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-80 to-gray-90 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-80 hover:border-green-50/50 transition-all duration-300">
							<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-50 mb-2">Automated ARK</h3>
							<p class="text-cool-gray-20 text-sm mb-3">Auto-crafting stations and advanced automation systems</p>
							<div class="text-cool-gray-40 text-xs">Automation</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50/10 to-cyan-50/10 border border-green-50/30 rounded-xl p-6">
						<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Mod Installation</h3>
						<p class="text-cool-gray-20 mb-4">
							Installing mods is simple through QuackPlane:
						</p>
						<ol class="space-y-2 text-cool-gray-20 text-sm">
							<li class="flex gap-3">
								<span class="text-green-50 font-bold">1.</span>
								<span>Find the mod on Steam Workshop and copy its Workshop ID</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-3">
								<span class="text-green-50 font-bold">2.</span>
								<span>Paste the Workshop ID into QuackPlane's mod manager</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-3">
								<span class="text-green-50 font-bold">3.</span>
								<span>Click install and restart your server</span>
							</li>
						</ol>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FAQ Section -->
		<section class="py-20 relative">
			<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
					<div class="text-center mb-16">
						<h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
							Frequently Asked Questions
						</h2>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<details class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-80 overflow-hidden group">
							<summary class="px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-white font-semibold hover:text-[#FF9C20] transition-colors">
								<span>How many players can I host on an ARK server?</span>
								<span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
							</summary>
							<div class="px-8 pb-6 text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								<p class="mb-4">Player capacity depends on your plan and server configuration:</p>
								<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
									<li><strong class="text-white">Duck (8GB):</strong> 10-15 players comfortably</li>
									<li><strong class="text-white">Goose (16GB):</strong> 25-40 players with mods</li>
									<li><strong class="text-white">Swan (32GB):</strong> 50-70 players with extensive mods</li>
								</ul>
								<p class="mt-4">Performance also depends on active dino counts, building complexity, and installed mods. We recommend monitoring server performance and upgrading if you experience lag.</p>
							</div>
						</details>

						<details class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-80 overflow-hidden group">
							<summary class="px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-white font-semibold hover:text-[#FF9C20] transition-colors">
								<span>Can I transfer my existing ARK server to QuackHost?</span>
								<span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
							</summary>
							<div class="px-8 pb-6 text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								<p class="mb-4">Yes! We make server migration easy:</p>
								<ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
									<li>Download your saved world files from your current host</li>
									<li>Create a new ARK server on QuackHost</li>
									<li>Upload your world save through QuackPlane's file manager</li>
									<li>Restart the server and your world will load</li>
								</ol>
								<p class="mt-4">Your tribes, tames, bases, and progress will transfer seamlessly. Contact support if you need assistance with migration.</p>
							</div>
						</details>

						<details class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-80 overflow-hidden group">
							<summary class="px-8 py-6 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-white font-semibold hover:text-[#FF9C20] transition-colors">
								<span>How do I set up a cluster with multiple maps?</span>
								<span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">+</span>
							</summary>
							<div class="px-8 pb-6 text-cool-gray-20 leading-relaxed">
								<p class="mb-4">Clustering allows players to transfer characters and items between multiple ARK servers. Setup is straightforward:</p>
								<ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
									<li>Order multiple ARK servers (one for each map)</li>
									<li>Enable cluster mode in QuackPlane for each server</li>
									<li>Set the same cluster ID for all servers you want linked</li>
									<li>Players can now transfer between servers using obelisks or supply drops</li>
								</ol>
								<p class="mt-4">Popular cluster setups include The Island + Ragnarok + Valguero, or story progression clusters with all canon maps.</p>
							</div>
						</details>

						<details class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-90 to-gray-100 rounded-xl border border-gray-80 overflow-hidden group">
